---------------
 
(1 row)

DROP TABLE shared_table;
DROP TABLE secret_table;
DROP SCHEMA attacker_schema CASCADE;
NOTICE:  drop cascades to function attacker_schema.evil_list(text)
DROP ROLE incremental_attacker;
DROP EXTENSION pg_incremental;
NOTICE:  drop cascades to 2 other objects
DETAIL:  drop cascades to function incremental._drop_extension_trigger()
drop cascades to event trigger incremental_drop_extension_trigger
